= El enlace con las comunidades

*Corriente: la nueva izquierda. Cada acción suya fortalece a los renovadores — y roza a los ortodoxos, que aún no perdonan la sotana.*

A former seminarian who kept the option for the poor and lost the rest, he is the seam between two organizations that were never supposed to touch: the Party and the base communities. He speaks Marx to the cadres and the Beatitudes to the catechists and believes, without embarrassment, that they are footnotes to each other. Where he works, the parish hall and the cell become the same room, and the campesino brings both his rosary and his grievance, and no one asks him to choose.

